OL,3,GNEWSAMums need more support after
OL,4,AC-sections - I'm still recovering
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter undergoing two emergency
OL,7,FCaesarean sections in 2018 and 2021,
OL,8,FKyra had hoped a planned procedure to
OL,9,Fdeliver her third child would be
OL,10,Fdifferent.
OL,12,FThe surgery, on 22 October 2025, had
OL,13,Fbeen scheduled because her baby was in
OL,14,Fthe breech position, with his feet
OL,15,Fpositioned first.
OL,17,FRecalling the operation, the
OL,18,F36-year-old says: "They make it as
OL,19,Fcomfortable as possible for you.
OL,20,FThere's chatter and music playing, it's
OL,21,Fonly afterwards you realise this is
OL,22,Fmajor surgery."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
